1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,366
Agents have remarkable capabilities now.

2
00:00:02,316 --> 00:00:05,250
But without skills, every session is a cold start.

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:10,633
Skills give agents context — they encode your team's knowledge so the agent doesn't have to learn it from scratch every time.

4
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:13,483
SKILL.md is the format that makes this possible.

5
00:00:13,483 --> 00:00:20,091
It's a simple file, but the design principles matter — clear frontmatter, progressive disclosure, examples over abstractions.

6
00:00:20,091 --> 00:00:22,508
And always remember: skills are code.

7
00:00:22,508 --> 00:00:24,108
They run on your machine.

8
00:00:24,108 --> 00:00:25,725
Read before you install.

